---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---
<Base title="Support our work" description="How to support ForBetterCommunity USA, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit in Montana." hero={true}>
  <div slot="hero" class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Support our work</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-white/75 leading-relaxed">
      We are not running a campaign. Our field programs are paused, and asking for money
      for work that is not currently under way would not be honest.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Section title="What is useful to us right now">
    <div class="prose-fbc text-[16px]">
      <p>
        Three things move this organization forward at this stage, and none of them is a one-time gift.
      </p>
      <h3>Partners on the ground</h3>
      <p>
        Organizations and people working in Central America and the Caribbean who share the
        self-sufficiency approach, and who need a partner rather than a funder.
      </p>
      <h3>Skills</h3>
      <p>
        Agronomy, water systems, vocational training, cooperative governance. The projects we support
        are technical before they are charitable.
      </p>
      <h3>Funding for a defined program</h3>
      <p>
        We would rather discuss the funding of a specific program, with a scope and a horizon,
        than collect general donations against no active project.
      </p>
      <p>
        Write to
        <a href="mailto:contact@forbettercommunity.org">contact@forbettercommunity.org</a>
        and we will answer with what we actually need.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="sand" title="Giving">
    <div class="prose-fbc text-[16px]">
      <p>
        ForBetterCommunity USA is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit corporation. Contributions are tax-deductible to
        the extent allowed by U.S. federal law, and we issue a written acknowledgment for every gift.
      </p>
      <p>
        Online giving is not open at the moment. To make a contribution, contact us and we will provide
        the details and the acknowledgment your records require.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are a Canadian donor, note that
        <a href="https://canada.forbettercommunity.org">ForBetterCommunity Canada</a>
        is a distinct organization with its own status, and giving to the American entity does not
        produce a Canadian receipt.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
